<include file="Public:header"/>	<div class="mainbox">		<div id="nav" class="mainnav_title">			<ul>				<a href="{pigcms{:U('AppRedpack/app_list')}" class="on">打开其他苹果app列表</a>			</ul>		</div>		<div class="page_tips" style="position: relative;height: 68px;">			<button  onclick="window.top.artiframe('{pigcms{:U('AppRedpack/app_edit')}','添加APP',600,420,true,false,false,addbtn,'add',true);" class="button" style="margin-right: 14px;">添加APP</button>			说明：<div style="display: inline-block; float: left; position: absolute; top: 19px; line-height: 20px;">1. 该功能为平台苹果app支持打开另一个苹果app。<br/>2. 请先设置好要打开的苹果app url scheme 。<br/>3. 添加好其他app的url scheme后，可用于系统后台--系统设置广告管理或导航管理里选择要打开的其他app；系统后台其他app列表里添加好url scheme 后，需联系售后重新打包app才能生效</div>		</div>		<form name="myform" id="myform" action="" method="post">			<div class="table-list">				<table width="100%" cellspacing="0">					<thead>						<tr>							<th>编号</th>							<th>APP名称</th>							<th>url scheme</th>							<th>添加时间</th>							<th class="textcenter">操作</th>						</tr>					</thead>					<tbody>						<if condition="is_array($app_list)">							<volist name="app_list" id="vo">								<tr>									<td>{pigcms{$vo.pigcms_id}</td>									<td>{pigcms{$vo.name}</td>									<td>{pigcms{$vo.url_scheme}</td>									<td>{pigcms{$vo.time|date='Y-m-d H:i:s',###}</td>									<td class="textcenter"><a href="javascript:void(0);" onclick="window.top.artiframe('{pigcms{:U('AppRedpack/app_edit',array('id'=>$vo['pigcms_id']))}','编辑信息',600,420,true,false,false,editbtn,'add',true);">编辑</a> | <a href="javascript:void(0);" class="delete_row" parameter="id={pigcms{$vo.pigcms_id}" url="{pigcms{:U('AppRedpack/app_del')}">删除</a></td>								</tr>							</volist>						<else/>							<tr><td class="textcenter red" colspan="8">列表为空！</td></tr>						</if>					</tbody>				</table>			</div>		</form>	</div><include file="Public:footer"/>